---
id: 1
title: Log in with valid credentials
priority: critical
status: ready
tags:
  - login
  - smoke
---

A registered user signs in with a correct email and password and reaches the dashboard.

Preconditions:

1. A user account "user@example.com" with password "Secret123!" exists and is active
2. The browser is open on the login page

Scenario:

1. Enter "user@example.com" into the "Email" field
   > The field accepts the value with no validation error

2. Enter "Secret123!" into the "Password" field
   > The characters are masked

3. Click the "Sign in" button
   > 1. The browser is redirected to the dashboard
   > 2. A greeting with the signed-in user's name is shown
